# Runtime occupancy marker written into each task worktree (lib/worktree-claim.ts). Must be ignored:
# untracked files count as dirt, so a claimed worktree would read as "has uncommitted changes" — which
# both blocks the merge autopilot is waiting to do and makes `rm` refuse for the wrong reason, hiding
# the real one. Caught by QA before this shipped.
.minami-claim.json

# Task worktrees — each is a full checkout of this repo; never commit them into it.
.minami-worktrees/
.next-task/
.next-verify/
